# ============================================================
#  xxmz · .gitattributes
#  目的只有两个：别把二进制当文本 diff（否则历史膨胀、合并冲突无意义），
#  以及让 Windows（CRLF）/ macOS·Linux（LF）协作时的行尾问题可预期。
#  注意：本仓库现有 .py 多为 CRLF，**不做**全仓行尾归一化，避免一次
#  「改行尾」的巨型 diff 淹没真实改动。
# ============================================================

# ---- 二进制：禁止文本 diff / 合并 ----
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.wav  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.jks  binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk  binary
*.aab  binary
*.jar  binary
*.zip  binary
*.joblib binary
*.pyc  binary

# ---- 行尾：脚本与配置显式声明，减少跨平台噪音 ----
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# ---- 语言统计（GitHub 语种识别）----
*.dart linguist-language=Dart
sources/texts/*.txt linguist-documentation
